<section id="about" class="container">
    <div>
        <h2>About me</h2>
        <div class="content">
            <p>I am a results-driven administrative and operations professional with extensive experience in reporting, sales support, customer service, marketing coordination, and office management. I am adept at managing multiple priorities, improving processes, coordinating cross-functional projects, and supporting executive leadership.</p>

            <p>I combine strong analytical skills with creative marketing experience and a commitment to accuracy, customer service, and team success.</p>
            
            <p>I am skilled in business systems such as JDE, QlikView, Microsoft Office, Smartsheet, InDesign, Photoshop, and various supplier management platforms.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .container {
		container: about / inline-size;
        display: flex;
        gap: var(--gap);
    }

    .container > div {
        display: grid;
        gap: var(--gap);
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 3fr;
        background: light-dark(var(--blue-dark), rgb(51, 52, 80));
        color: light-dark(var(--white), rgb(51, 52, 80));
    }
    .content {
        column-count: 2;
        column-width: 25ch;
        margin-inline-start: auto;
        gap: var(--gap-large);
        position: relative;
        padding: var(--gap-large);
    }
    h2 {
        padding: var(--gap-large);
        color: light-dark(var(--white), rgb(51, 52, 80));
    }
    p {
        color: light-dark(var(--white), rgb(51, 52, 80));
    }
    p + p {
        margin-block-start: var(--gap-large);
    }

    @container about (width < 80ch) {
        .container > div {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0;
        }
        .content {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            width: auto;
            gap: unset;
            margin: 0;
            padding-block-start: 0;
        }
    }
</style>